<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank o/n up, one-week steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank o/n up, one-week steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The range of overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose on Tuesday in a slightly tight private sector market to between 8 and 8-1/8 percent from Monday's range of 6-1/2 and 8 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rate ranges were unchanged for the second day running at between 8 and 8-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>Bankers said that public sector banks kept their official minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
